<BaseLayout title="Preliminary Risk Disclaimer" description="Preliminary market-risk disclaimer for DepthLume analytics and research." path="/risk-disclaimer/">
  <article class="container prose-page">
    <header><span class="eyebrow">Legal / Preliminary</span><h1>Risk disclaimer</h1><p class="lede">DepthLume is an analytical research tool. It cannot remove market risk or determine the suitability of a trade.</p></header>
    <div class="provisional">This preliminary disclaimer requires final legal review before public launch or software distribution.</div>
    <section><h2>Substantial risk of loss</h2><p>Cryptocurrency futures and leveraged products are highly volatile and can produce losses quickly. They may not be suitable for every person. Never risk funds you cannot afford to lose.</p></section>
    <section><h2>No financial advice</h2><p>DepthLume provides market data organization, analytics and explainable context for research. Nothing produced by the website or application is financial advice, a recommendation, an offer or a solicitation.</p></section>
    <section><h2>No guarantee</h2><p>No analysis, scenario, context label or data point guarantees profitability or any particular outcome. Context strength is not a probability of profit.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Data and model limitations</h2><p>Public market data can be delayed, incomplete, inaccurate or unavailable. Detection logic can produce false positives and false negatives. Historical observations and replay do not ensure future behavior.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Independent decisions</h2><p>DepthLume does not execute trades or manage funds. Users must independently verify information, assess risk and make their own decisions.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
